## Get Lyrics by Track

```
GET /tracks/:id/lyrics
```

Returns all lyrics variants for a track.

### Response

```json
{
  "data": [
    {
      "id": "uuid",
      "track_id": "uuid",
      "language": "en",
      "variant": "original",
      "content": "Lyrics text here..."
    }
  ]
}
```

## Add Lyrics

```
POST /tracks/:id/lyrics
```

Add a new lyrics variant. Requires authentication.

### Request Body

```json
{
  "language": "en",
  "variant": "translated",
  "content": "Translated lyrics..."
}
```

## Delete Lyrics

```
DELETE /lyrics/:lyricId
```

Delete a lyrics entry. Requires authentication.
